@startuml
title Level 1: System Context - MCP Banking API

skinparam {
  ActorBackgroundColor #3498DB
  ActorBorderColor #2980B9
  ComponentBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  ComponentBorderColor #34495E
  CloudBackgroundColor #F9E79F
  CloudBorderColor #F39C12
  StorageBackgroundColor #D5F4E6
  StorageBorderColor #27AE60
  ArrowThickness 2
  linetype ortho
  
  Padding 20
  BoxPadding 30
  nodesep 90
  ranksep 100
}

actor " AI Agent\n(Claude, ChatGPT)" as AI
actor " Human User\n(Mobile/Web App)" as USER

package "MCP Banking API Server" as SERVER {
  component "MCP Protocol\n/mcp" as MCP #5DADE2
  component "REST API\n/api/v1/*" as API #52BE80
  component "Health Check\n/health" as HEALTH #82E0AA
}

cloud " Langfuse\nObservability Platform" as OBS
database " In-Memory\nData Stores" as STORAGE

' Espacement horizontal
MCP -[hidden]right-> API
API -[hidden]right-> HEALTH

AI -down-> MCP : <b>POST /mcp</b>\nMCP tool invocations

USER -down-> API : <b>GET/POST</b>\nCustomer & Account operations
USER -down-> HEALTH : <b>GET /health</b>\nSystem status

MCP -right-> OBS : Telemetry & traces\n(PII redacted)
MCP -down-> API : Some tool flows via internal httpx calls\n(localhost)
API -down-> STORAGE : CRUD operations\n(customers, accounts)

note right of MCP #FFF9E6
  <b>MCP Layer Components:</b>
  • Tool metadata: <i>mcp.json</i>
  • Tool handlers: <i>main.py</i>
  • FastMCP server
  • Auth middleware (MCP_AUTH_TOKEN)
  • Internal native tool: <i>run_automation_maven_tests</i>
end note

note left of API #E8F8F5
  <b>REST API Components:</b>
  • FastAPI app: <i>fastapi_app/app.py</i>
  • Pydantic schemas: <i>models.py</i>
  • Configuration: <i>config.py</i>
  • Endpoints: customers, accounts, health
end note

note bottom of STORAGE #D5F4E6
  <b>Storage:</b>
  • customer_store (in-memory dict)
  • mock_accounts_db (in-memory dict)
  • Production: PostgreSQL/MySQL
end note

legend right
  |= Component |= Technology |
  | MCP Server | FastMCP + Python |
  | REST API | FastAPI + Pydantic |
  | Observability | Langfuse |
  | Storage | In-Memory (demo) |
endlegend
@enduml